.SS "#define P4EST_CONN_DISK_PERIODIC"

.PP
The \fBp4est_connectivity_new_disk\fP function now accepts a bool arg\&. The same holds for \fBp4est_wrap_new_disk\fP\&. 
.SS "#define P4EST_REALLOC(p, t, n)"
\fBValue:\fP
.PP
.nf
                                                    (t *) sc_realloc (p4est_package_id,   \
                                                    (p), (n) * sizeof(t))
.fi
.PP
reallocate the \fIt-array\fP \fIp\fP with \fIn\fP elements 
.SS "#define P4EST_SEARCH_LOCAL"

.PP
The \fBp4est_search_local\fP function replaces \fBp4est_search\fP\&. The latter function is still available with updated internal semantics\&. Furthermore, we have added \fBp4est_search_partition\fP to search the parallel partition without accessing any local elements, and \fBp4est_search_all\fP that combines the two\&. 
